      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '-gani uchun' yoki '-ib' ga to'g'ri keladi: 'og'rigani uchun keldim' = 아파서 왔어요. O'zbekchada ham 'og'rigani uchun' ichida zamon yo'q — zamon oxirgi fe'lda: keldim.",
      "compare_en": "Matches English 'because' or '…, so…': 'I came because it hurts' = 아파서 왔어요. But note: in English both parts can have a tense ('because I was sick, I stayed home'); in Korean only the last verb shows the tense: 아파서 집에 있었어요."
