    {
      "id": "u07_l2_g2",
      "pattern": "N(이)라서",
      "meaning_uz": "Ot bilan sabab: '...bo'lgani uchun'",
      "meaning_en": "Reason with a noun: 'because it is…'",
      "explanation_md": "**N(이)라서** — otdan keyin keladigan sabab shakli: **\"...bo'lgani uchun\"**. Bu aslida **이다 + -아서** ning maxsus shakli.\n\n**감기라서 괜찮아요.** — *Shunchaki shamollash bo'lgani uchun xavotirli emas.*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n- **받침 yo'q** → **-라서**: 감기 → **감기라서**, 친구 → **친구라서**\n- **받침 bor** → **-이라서**: 휴일 → **휴일이라서**, 학생 → **학생이라서**, 외국인 → **외국인이라서**\n\n### Misollar\n\n- 오늘은 **휴일이라서** 사람이 많아요. — *Bugun dam olish kuni bo'lgani uchun odam ko'p.*\n- **처음이라서** 잘 몰라요. — *Birinchi marta bo'lgani uchun yaxshi bilmayman.*\n- 내일 **시험이라서** 바빠요. — *Ertaga imtihon bo'lgani uchun bandman.*\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n**-아서/어서** dagi qoidalar bu yerda ham amal qiladi: oldidan o'tgan zamon qo'yilmaydi va keyin buyruq kelmaydi.\n\n~~학생라서~~ ❌ — 받침 bor bo'lsa **이** kerak: **학생이라서** ✅",
      "explanation_md_en": "**N(이)라서** is the reason form after a noun: **\"because it is (a) …\"**. It is really a special form of **이다 + -아서**.\n\n**감기라서 괜찮아요.** — *It's just a cold, so it's nothing to worry about.*\n\n### How to form it\n\n- **No 받침** → **-라서**: 감기 → **감기라서**, 친구 → **친구라서**\n- **With 받침** → **-이라서**: 휴일 → **휴일이라서**, 학생 → **학생이라서**, 외국인 → **외국인이라서**\n\n### Examples\n\n- 오늘은 **휴일이라서** 사람이 많아요. — *It's a holiday today, so there are lots of people.*\n- **처음이라서** 잘 몰라요. — *It's my first time, so I don't know well.*\n- 내일 **시험이라서** 바빠요. — *I have an exam tomorrow, so I'm busy.*\n\n### Remember\n\nThe **-아서/어서** rules apply here too: no past tense before it and no request after it.\n\n~~학생라서~~ ❌ — with 받침 you need **이**: **학생이라서** ✅",
